---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Section from "../components/Section.astro";
import CtaButton from "../components/CtaButton.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="1:1 Training"
  description="Hands-on 1:1 AI development training — one of Serpico AI's consulting engagement formats."
>
  <Section title="1:1 Training">
    <p>Learn to build your own software with AI. Hands-on sessions where you do all the work and keep all the code — one engagement format within our broader AI consulting practice.</p>
  </Section>

  <Section title="How It Works" alt>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Expert-Led Instruction</strong> — Every session is taught by someone actively deploying AI, not reading from outdated slides.</li>
      <li><strong>Book a Session</strong> — Pick a time. $175/hour, paid before we start.</li>
      <li><strong>Bring Your Idea</strong> — An app, a workflow, a product, whatever you want to build. And your laptop.</li>
      <li><strong>You Build, We Teach</strong> — Your instructor guides you through architecture, prompting, debugging, and deployment. You write every prompt and make every decision.</li>
      <li><strong>Walk Away With Skills &amp; a Tool to Meet Your Need</strong> — You leave with a working application and the ability to build the next one without help.</li>
    </ol>
    <CtaButton href="/contact" variant="primary">Book a Session</CtaButton>
  </Section>

  <Section title="Frequently Asked Questions">
    <h3>Do I need to know coding to join?</h3>
    <p>Not at all! Most clients have never written a line of code. No technical or coding experience is required.</p>

    <h3>How many training sessions should I plan for?</h3>
    <p>It depends on your project's complexity. We suggest starting with two hours. This gives you and your instructor time to map out a plan, recommend additional sessions, and kick things off smoothly.</p>

    <h3>What tools will we use during the sessions?</h3>
    <p>It depends on what you want to build. If you have a specific tool in mind, we'll pair you with an instructor who specializes in it. Otherwise, we'll help identify the best tools for your project.</p>

    <h3>What happens if I get stuck after?</h3>
    <p>Book a follow-up session anytime.</p>

    <h3>Is the $175/hour rate a good investment?</h3>
    <p>Most clients achieve in 1-3 sessions what could take weeks and cost thousands to outsource — plus you're gaining skills that will benefit every future project.</p>

    <h3>What's the step-by-step process to get started?</h3>
    <p>Step 1: Book your session. Once booked, we'll connect with you for a discovery call to understand your needs and match you with the right instructor. Step 2: We'll help you schedule time, either in person or online. Step 3: Meet your instructor and start building — together you'll design and create the tools, software, or systems you need.</p>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>
